#. 奪われた記憶と関係してるのって、
#. ボク達に殺し合いをさせる<CLT 3>“動機”<CLT>の事だよな…？
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"You're talking about the <CLT 3>motives<CLT> you provided to try\n"
"and get us to kill each other, right?"
msgstr ""

#. やっぱ覚えてた？
#. まぁ、そんな大事な事を忘れる訳がないよね。
msgctxt "0002 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"So you do remember, after all. Well, I would hope you\n"
"wouldn't forget something so important."
msgstr ""

#. まさに愚問…ご無礼のありました段、
#. 重ねて謹んでお詫び申し上げておくよ。
msgctxt "0003 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"It was stupid of me to even ask. I apologize from the\n"
"bottom of my heart for my bad manners."
msgstr ""

#. では、改めての質問だけどさ…
msgctxt "0004 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "So then, let me ask you another question."
msgstr ""

#. これまでアタシが提示してきた動機には、
#. それぞれ、独自の<CLT 3>テーマ<CLT>があったのは知ってるかな？
msgctxt "0005 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Did you notice that each motive I presented you had a\n"
"<CLT 3>specific theme<CLT> to it?"
msgstr ""

#. テーマ…？
msgctxt "0006 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "A th-theme...?"
msgstr ""

#. うんうん、そうなんだ。
#. それをみなさんへの問題にしようと思うんだよ。
msgctxt "0007 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Yup, you got it. So that's my question to you all..."
msgstr ""

#. さて、最初の舞園さんの殺人の時、
#. アタシが提示した動機にはどんなテーマがあったかな？
msgctxt "0008 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"When Sayaka was murdered, what was the theme of the\n"
"motive I presented?"
msgstr ""

#. 人間関係
msgctxt "0009 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Human connections"
msgstr ""

#. 三角関係
msgctxt "0010 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Love triangles"
msgstr ""

#. や、やっぱりそうだったのねッ…！！
msgctxt "0011 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "I kn-knew it!"
msgstr ""

#. 舞園があんたと部屋を交換しただなんて、
#. お、おかしいと思ったのよ…
msgctxt "0012 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"I always thought it was f-funny how you guys just\n"
"decided to s-switch rooms all of a sudden."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木と…舞園と…桑田…
msgctxt "0013 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "You...and Sayaka...and L-Leon...!"
msgstr ""

#. …………………
msgctxt "0014 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. …………………
msgctxt "0015 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. い、いやらしいわッ！！
msgctxt "0016 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "How scandalously i-i-indecent!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>腐川さんの事は放っておくとして、
#. とにかく、三角関係は関係ないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Regardless of what Toko might think, that's not what\n"
"this is about...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. 国際関係
msgctxt "0019 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "International relations"
msgstr ""

#. 超高校級のアイドルである舞園っち…
#. いずれは、世界に羽ばたいたはずだべ。
msgctxt "0020 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"As the Ultimate Pop Sensation, Sayaka would have\n"
"eventually spread her wings across the globe."
msgstr ""

#. そんな未来の世界的アイドルを殺す事で…
#. 国家間に摩擦を生じさせようとしたんだべ！！
msgctxt "0021 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"By killing a world-famous superstar, they wanted to\n"
"create tension between everyone on Earth!"
msgstr ""

#. …実にくだらん。
msgctxt "0022 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Verbal garbage."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>葉隠クンの説は置いとくとしても…
#. 動機とは関係なさそうだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Leaving Hiro's \"theory\" alone, I don't see any\n"
"realistic motive there...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. ほらほら、思い出してごらんよ！
msgctxt "0025 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Come on, you gotta remember!"
msgstr ""

#. 舞園さんが殺された、
#. あの最初の殺人をさ…！
msgctxt "0026 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "That first murder! The death of Sayaka!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あの時…
#. モノクマはボクらにＤＶＤを配って…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Before she died, Monokuma gave us all our own DVD.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>舞園さんはそれを見て…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>When Sayaka saw that...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>最初の殺人の時…
#. モノクマが提示した動機のテーマ…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The theme for the motive Monokuma gave us for the\n"
"first murder...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>最初の殺人の時…
#. モノクマが提示した動機のテーマ…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The theme for the motive Monokuma gave us for the\n"
"first murder...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あの時、モノクマはボクらにＤＶＤを配ったんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Monokuma gave us those DVDs...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクの受け取ったＤＶＤには、
#. ボクの家族が映ってて…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>On my DVD was footage of my family.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>舞園さんが受け取ったＤＶＤには、
#. 夢を共有する仲間が映ってた…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>On Sayaka's was...her and her friends. They had a\n"
"dream they all shared...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だとすると、最初の殺人の時、
#. ボクらに提示された動機のテーマって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So for the first murder, the motive we were given\n"
"was...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
